  "body": "If you're looking for a beautifully presented home offering space, versatility and a lovely sea view, this could be the one.\r\nTastefully renovated and thoughtfully configured over two levels, this family-friendly home provides plenty of options. It's ideal for first-home buyers wanting extra space for a flatmate to help with the mortgage, families with teenagers, or those looking to accommodate extended family.\r\nUpstairs, the spacious living area enjoys a lovely sea view and flows onto a large sun-filled deck, the perfect spot for summer BBQs with friends and family or simply relaxing at the end of the day. A modern kitchen, master bedroom and ensuite complete this level.\r\nDownstairs offers excellent separation, with two further bedrooms, a bathroom and a generous second living area, creating a versatile space for family, teenagers, guests or a flatmate.\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section provides a safe and secure environment for children and pets, while the large single garage and workshop area offers plenty of room for hobbies, tools and additional storage.\r\nThe location adds even more appeal, with Glamorgan School within easy walking distance and public transport conveniently close by.\r\nSolid block and brick construction provides the reassurance of a home that has stood the test of time, combined with a low-maintenance exterior that's ideal for today's busy lifestyle. For those who travel regularly, it also offers the convenience of a home that's easy to lock up and leave.\r\nBeautifully renovated inside, there's nothing you need to do except move in and start enjoying your new home.\r\nAfter 14 happy years, our owners are relocating and it's time for another family to enjoy everything this wonderful home has to offer.\r\nEarly settlement is available.",
